"""Hand-authored per-species fit annotations, written while viewing the portraits.

Each species entry describes ANATOMY seen in the art. Per-presentation overrides
record where a presentation differs (anatomy or existing clothing). Nothing here
assumes a presentation inherits the male fit: every override was checked against
that presentation's own image.

Group vocabulary (fit groups are suggestions for artwork sharing, not proof of fit):
  lower.*   lower-body garment construction
  sleeve.*  sleeve/arm garment construction
  hand.*    glove / hand-layer construction
  foot.*    footwear construction (or the reason footwear is not possible)
Torso groups are derived in build.py from measured shoulder width/height plus the
`back` modifier given here.
"""

